---
// "Start here" block for the $350 Brand Gut-Check.
// Copy lifted from PUNK LOTUS/punklotus-services-page-gutcheck-addition-2026-08-19.md (Kirsty-approved direction).
// TODO: point the button at the Gut-Check page once its payment flow is live.
---
<section class="section section--orange gut">
  <div class="wrap split reveal">
    <div class="gc-head">
      <p class="hand">Start here</p>
      <h2>The Brand Gut-Check</h2>
      <span class="sticker" aria-hidden="true">$350<small>no strings</small></span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lede">An honest read on your brand before you commit to anything bigger.</p>
      <p>Send your site and socials, get back a short, sharp read on what's working and what to fix first. $350, standalone — no strings, no upsell.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/#contact">Book a Gut-Check</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .gut h2 { margin: .2em 0 0; }
  .gc-head { position: relative; padding-right: 120px; }
  .sticker {
    position: absolute; right: 0; top: -12px; width: 112px; height: 112px; border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: var(--black); color: var(--cream-light); transform: rotate(12deg);
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.9rem; line-height: 1;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--cream-light);
  }
  .sticker small { font-family: var(--font-hand); font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--orange); }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .gc-head { padding-right: 100px; } .sticker { width: 88px; height: 88px; font-size: 1.4rem; } }
</style>
